>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. The terpyridine hydrogen count is complete. The hydrogen-free O in the input is close to one Cl. The fixed-coordinate calculation supports a Cl–O bond. Assign one hypochlorite, two chlorides and Y(III), This assignment requires neither a hydrogen from water nor Y(+5). Localized 18 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

